l inflammatory process.\n\n**Preliminary interpretation**\nAt this stage, the most supported possibilities are:\n- **General medical fatigue related to kidney/cardiovascular context**, because your stored history already shows hypertension and CKD-related risk.\n- **Medication or blood-pressure-related fatigue**, especially if your pressure has been running too high, fluctuating, or if treatment changed.\n- **Common non-specific causes** such as poor sleep, anemia, infection/inflammation, low mood, or thyroid/metabolic issues.\nA dangerous cause is **cardiac strain or another systemic illness**, but I do **not** yet have enough detail to rank that highly. If you also have **chest pain, shortness of breath at rest, fainting, black stools, rapid worsening, or one-sided weakness**, tell me immediately.\n\n**Recommended questions**\nBy answering a few targeted questions, we can narrow this down more safely and precisely.\n\n**(1/4)** When you say exhausted, do you mean mainly **sleepiness**, **physical weakness**, **shortness of breath with effort**, or a more general **low-energy / drained** feeling?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_030a07b45d8f1af40169da12bb0c948191a42b965c5ca02075\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":195,"output":384,"cacheRead":19840,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20419,"cost":{"input":0.00048750000000000003,"output":0.00576,"cacheRead":0.00496,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0112075}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775899321340}}
