\n- If you have a smartwatch with current heart rate / oxygen / ECG alerts, you can bring that information, but **do not delay leaving** to gather extra data.\n\n**If symptoms worsen before help arrives**\nIf you develop worse chest pain, severe trouble breathing, fainting, confusion, or cannot speak full sentences, treat that as an **immediate emergency**.\n\n**Reply to me with just one word if you can**\n**ambulance** or **going**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_030a07b45d8f1af40169da13facec48191b8a7c7cfc959735d\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":673,"output":257,"cacheRead":20864,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21794,"cost":{"input":0.0016825000000000002,"output":0.003855,"cacheRead":0.005216,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0107535}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775899638081}}
